msgid "Admin configuration"
msgstr "Configurarea Adminului"

msgid "also given by your host provider"
msgstr "De asemenea oferita de host"

msgid "An alternate solution is to copy the text in the box above and paste it into the file \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Warning : database.inc.php must only contain what is in the textarea, no line return or space character)"
msgstr "O solutie alternativa ar fi sa copiezi textul din casuta de deasupra si sa il scrii in fila \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Atentie database.inc.php trebuie sa contina doar caracterele din text, fara linie sau space)"

msgid "Basic configuration"
msgstr "Configurarea de baza"

msgid "Can't connect to server"
msgstr "Nu se poate conecta la server"

msgid "Congratulations, Piwigo installation is completed"
msgstr "Felicitari, Piwigo s-a instalat cu succes."

msgid "Connection to server succeed, but it was impossible to connect to database"
msgstr "Conectarea la server reusita, dar conexiunea cu baza de data este imposibila"

msgid "Creation of config file local/config/database.inc.php failed."
msgstr "Creearea filei local/config/database.inc.php a esuat"

msgid "Database configuration"
msgstr "Configurarea datezi de baze"

msgid "Database name"
msgstr "Numele bazei de date"

msgid "Database table prefix"
msgstr "Prefixele tabelelor bazei de date"

msgid "database tables names will be prefixed with it (enables you to manage better your tables)"
msgstr "Tabelele bazei de date vor avea prefix ( permitandu-ti o mai usoara administrare)"

msgid "Default gallery language"
msgstr "Limba default a galeriei"

msgid "Don't hesitate to consult our forums for any help : %s"
msgstr "Nu ezita sa vizitezi forumul pentru ajutor %s"

msgid "Download the config file"
msgstr "Descarca fila de configurare"

msgid "enter a login for webmaster"
msgstr "Introduceti userul pentru webmaster"

msgid "Hope to see you back soon."
msgstr "Speram sa te revedem curand! Pa."

msgid "Host"
msgstr "Host"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalare"

msgid "It appears your webhost is currently running PHP %s."
msgstr "Se pare ca webhostul tau ruleaza PHP %s."

msgid "It will be shown to the visitors. It is necessary for website administration"
msgstr "Va fi afisata vizitatorilor. Este necesara pentru administrarea site-ului."

msgid "Just another Piwigo gallery"
msgstr "Doar o alta galerie Piwigo"

msgid "Keep it confidential, it enables you to access administration panel"
msgstr "Tine-o secreta, iti permite accesul la panoul de administrare"

msgid "Need help ? Ask your question on <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo message board</a>."
msgstr "Ai nevoie de ajutor? Intreaba pe <a href=\"%s\">Forumul Piwigo</a>."

msgid "Note you can change your configuration by yourself and restart Piwigo after that."
msgstr "Poti sa schimbi configuratia manual si sa restartezi Piwigo dupa aceea."

msgid "Password [confirm]"
msgstr "Parola [confirma]"

msgid "PHP 5 is required"
msgstr "PHP5.2 este necesar"

msgid "Piwigo may try to switch your configuration to PHP 5 by creating or modifying a .htaccess file."
msgstr "Piwigo va incerca sa treaca configuratia ta la PHP5.2 folosind o fila  .htaccess"

msgid "Piwigo was not able to configure PHP 5."
msgstr "Piwigo nu a putut sa configureze PHP5.2"

msgid "please enter your password again"
msgstr "Introduce parola inca o data"

msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Imi pare rau!"

msgid "Start Install"
msgstr "Incepe instalarea"

msgid "Try to configure PHP 5"
msgstr "Incearca sa configurezi PHP5.2"

msgid "user login given by your host provider"
msgstr "Userul oferit de providerul de host."

msgid "user password given by your host provider"
msgstr "Parola oferita de providerul de host"

msgid "User"
msgstr "User"

msgid "verification"
msgstr "verificarea"

msgid "Visitors will be able to contact site administrator with this mail"
msgstr "Vizitatorii vor folosii aceasta adresa pentru a contacta administratorul"

msgid "webmaster login can't contain characters ' or \""
msgstr "Userul nu poate sa contina caracterele ' sau \""

msgid "Welcome to my photo gallery"
msgstr "Bine ati venit la galeria mea foto"

msgid "Welcome to your new installation of Piwigo!"
msgstr "Bine ai venit la noua instalare Piwigo!"

msgid "You can download the config file and upload it to local/config directory of your installation."
msgstr "Poti sa descarci fila de configurare si sa o uploadezi in folderul local/config al instalarii."

msgid "You may referer to your hosting provider's support and see how you could switch to PHP 5 by yourself."
msgstr "Ar trebui sa te adresezi hostului si sa intrebi cum poti sa treci la PHP5.2"

msgid "localhost or other, supplied by your host provider"
msgstr "localhost sau alta, furnizat de furnizorul de găzduire"

msgid "PHP version %s required (you are running on PHP %s)"
msgstr "Este necesară versiunea PHP %s (acum utilizați PHP %s)"

